          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": null,
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Какие способы дополнительного заработка сейчас обсуждаете?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:00.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810001",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1001",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:1:11",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1000",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Я хочу продавать чужие физические товары за комиссию. Ищу партнёрскую программу без закупки склада.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:01.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:01.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810001",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1002",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:1:12",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1001",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Ты производишь товары и набираешь продавцов или сам хочешь стать продавцом?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:02.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:02.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810001",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1003",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:1:11",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1002",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Сам хочу стать продавцом. Своих товаров нет; нужны условия комиссии и поставщик, который отправляет покупателям.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:03.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:03.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810001",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1004",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:1:10",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1003",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Понял, а страна и категория товаров уже выбраны?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:04.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:04.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810001",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1005",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:1:11",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1004",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Пока нет. Сначала сравню условия, ничего ещё не выбрал.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:05.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:01:05.000Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "A002",
      "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
      "chat_id": "810002",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1000",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:2:20",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": null,
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Шукаю партнерську програму: хочу сам продавати чужі фізичні товари й отримувати комісію. Не послуги і не вакансію.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:00.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1001",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:2:21",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1000",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "У мене власний бренд, шукаю дилерів. Ти теж шукаєш дилерів?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:01.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:01.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1002",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:2:20",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1001",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Ні, власного бренду не маю. Хочу бути партнером чужого виробника, без початкової закупівлі.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:02.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:02.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1003",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:2:22",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1002",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "А категорія та умови доставки?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:03.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:03.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810002",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1004",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:2:20",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1003",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Ще не визначив; потрібні перевірені умови. Згоди на особисті повідомлення не давав.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:04.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:02:04.000Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "A003",
      "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
      "chat_id": "810003",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1000",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:30",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": null,
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Коллеги, как организуете работу с клиентами после консультации?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:00.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1001",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:31",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1000",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Я массажист, работаю со своими клиентами. Хочу добавить товарное направление: физические товары для домашнего ухода.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:01.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:01.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1002",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:32",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1001",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Это совет клиенту или ты лично ищешь партнёрский ассортимент?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:02.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:02.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1003",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:31",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1002",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Лично ищу ассортимент для своих клиентов как дополнительное направление. Сначала изучу составы, цены и условия; ничего не рекомендую пока.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:03.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:03.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1004",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:30",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1003",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Есть уже выбранный бренд?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:04.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:04.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810003",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1005",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:3:31",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1004",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Нет. Страна доставки и пригодность конкретных товаров ещё не установлены.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:05.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:03:05.000Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case_id": "A004",
      "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810004",
      "chat_id": "810004",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810004",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
