          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": null,
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Что нового у местных производителей?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:00.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:00.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810005",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1001",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:5:51",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1000",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Я владелец производства керамики. Ищу продавцов наших товаров и региональных дистрибьюторов, плачу комиссию с продаж.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:01.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:01.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810005",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1002",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:5:52",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1001",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Ты сам хочешь продавать чужие товары за комиссию?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:02.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:02.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810005",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1003",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:5:51",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1002",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Нет, товары наши. Мне нужны люди, которые будут продавать нашу керамику, а не программа для меня.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:03.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:03.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810005",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1004",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:5:50",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1003",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "То есть ты поставщик и расширяешь сеть сбыта?",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:04.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:04.000Z"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "public:repolab:chat:810005",
          "source_kind": "sanitized_fixture",
          "message_id": "1005",
          "author_id": "repolab-author:5:51",
          "display_name": null,
          "thread_id": null,
          "reply_to_id": "1004",
          "version": 1,
          "operation": "upsert",
          "text": "Да, именно так. Региональные условия обсудим отдельно.",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:05.000Z",
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T00:05:05.000Z"
        }
      ]
    },
